{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>And it rested</b> Two times in the Masorah: ותנח התיבה. ותנח עליהם הרוח. To teach that the holy spirit rested upon those who remained in the ark — and this is ותנח עליהם הרוח:" "<b>Ararat</b> Three times in the Masorah: here, and two regarding Sennacherib: ויהי וגו' בית נסרוך אלהיו וגו' והמה נמלטו ארץ אררט. And the Sages said: he took one plank from the ark and said, 'This is the god who saved Noah from the flood.' נסרוך — the language of נסר.'"], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:15:49.297626085Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}